PUBLIC WATER - Marion County Utilities future water customer - permit review COMPLETE but before the first building inspection can be made, MCU requires (1) payment of water connection fees was invoiced by MCU and ATTACH to the permit’s file, and (2) opening of utility account.  DO NOT CALL OR EMAIL MCU for the invoice, make sure the communication tap has the correct email address.  Please pay the connection invoice to MCU only and submit account setup documents to MCU HQ in Belleview or at Growth Services building (preferred). For meter installations up-dates email; Utilities@MarionFL.org and it will be handled promptly.

PARTIAL ACCOUNT APPLICATIONS or PAYMENTS WILL NOT BE ACCEPTED and are not sufficient to release INSP HOLDs.   

